Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 19:22:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: add error detection for missing config and name clash in
 Java interop

MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Created-by: guan_jh_dut <guan_jh_dut@163.com>
Commit-by: guan_jh_dut <guan_jh_dut@163.com>
Merged-by:
Description: ## 变更内容（必填）

1. 添加缺少配置时的错误检测：当lambda_patterns、tuple_configuration或generic_object_configuration缺失时，编译器不再崩溃，而是报告明确的错误信息。
2. 添加名称冲突检测：检测属性生成的getter/setter方法名是否与现有方法名冲突。
3. 新增诊断错误信息：
   - sema_cj_mapping_func_type_not_configured
   - sema_cj_mapping_tuple_type_not_configured
   - sema_cj_mapping_generic_type_not_configured
   - sema_cj_mapping_name_clash

